{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkiKuvxkm8iDFuWjLEm6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **\"כספי (שקלי)\"**, number 13254, though I'm only fairly sure. Before I sign anything I'd ask you, or ask at Harel.\n\nIt says **0%** for \"מניות\" and **0%** for \"מט\"ח\", so there are no shares and no foreign money in it. \"שקלי\" means shekels, so it sounds closest to my deposit. It's also one of the few safe-looking ones that shows a number: **4.25%** next to \"3 שנים\". The fee is \"0.57% מההיסכון\", about the same as all the others.\n\nWhat I looked at, in order:\n- **Top of the page:** \"הראל\" is a name I trust. The line about \"דמי הניהול\" was good, because the fee is what I wanted to check. Then a lot of buttons. The one marked was \"קופת גמל להשקעה 16\", which is what I came for. Under that, more buttons with \"S&P 500\" and \"עוקב מדד\", and I didn't know what they meant.\n- **The table:** I went down the right side, reading the names of the tracks.\n  - I skipped \"מניות\", \"משולב סחיר\", \"S&P 500\" and the \"עוקב מדד\" ones. Shares are gambling to me.\n  - The **24.04%** on \"מניות\" stuck in my head, but it's shares, so not for me.\n  - I stopped at two tracks: \"אג\"ח סחיר\", because I know bonds are safe, and \"כספי (שקלי)\". Both say 0% shares.\n  - On \"אג\"ח סחיר\" the return only says \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". I think that means it's too new to have a number, so there was nothing to compare. That's why I chose \"כספי (שקלי)\", the one with a number.\n  - I didn't understand \"עוקב מדדי אג\"ח\". I thought מדד was the price index on the news.\n- **Below the table:** I glanced at \"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\". It's a list of folded sections, and I didn't open them. At the bottom there's a search box.\n\nWords I didn't understand:\n- \"עוקב מדד\", \"S&P 500\", \"סחיר\", \"מט\"ח\" (as a share of the money)\n- \"חשיפה\"\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where a number should be\n- \"קופה\" with a five-digit number next to it\n- the two percentages (\"3 שנים\", \"5 שנים\"): I didn't know if they meant per year or in total\n- \"לפני דמי ניהול\"\n- the coloured circles. I didn't try to read them, and the blue and yellow look alike.\n\nHard to read:\n- The whole page is black with grey writing.\n- The small lines under the table are hard to read. One says the law allows up to 1.05% and 4%, another talks about other costs \"לא כשורה בחשבון\".\n- The dotted underlines under the numbers made me wonder if I'm meant to click them.\n\nWhat worried me:\n- The table is full of numbers in two rows each, and that made me nervous.\n- One line says past return \"לא אומרת מה יקרה בהמשך\".\n- Nothing on the page compares any of this to a bank deposit, so I still don't know if it's really better than mine.\n- I don't know who runs this site.\n- I got tired around the third screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3645,"cache_read_input_tokens":7841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3645},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ad376ec-1b1c-488f-ad5c-610d0acd3df3","uuid":"bdffc1f3-f332-47c4-bb2f-df5ab5476ca5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:17:39.559Z","request_id":"req_011CgkiKuhpMXQcKU7shejcH"}
